ationExtension (android auto)\nTrafficLightExtension (see https://www.overtake.gg/downloads/traffic-lights.77584/)", "created_at": "2025-06-27T14:33:38Z", "repo": "SimHubUDPConnector", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "300e7023bdc86963d92c34f50be38f881aa31913", "message": "Version 1.0.8\nAdded the car script for RSS Formula 2010.\nNew extension WeatherExtension to get weatherFX data.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:03:17Z", "repo": "SimHubUDPConnector", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e8b85d1eae9e1670199f37e8c3b4a29c54c02a6", "message": "New extension : WeatherExtension", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:50:40Z", "repo": "SimHubUDPConnector", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ee2232f5ac43d186c990275fd51c8bac2d8cb74c", "message": "Added the car script for RSS Formula 2010", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:49:54Z", "repo": "SimHubUDPConnector", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d277bc76b5cfeff422d1fee7b2d010192e52d79d", "message": "Update Bass shaker Road Rumble profiles : Dynamic frequencies disabled by default and script easier to tune\nAdded back the python examples", "created_at": "2025-05-22T00:26:03Z", "repo": "SimHubUDPConnector", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "41d0691f5cb0e0cd5c8af530e0a668e714ec08df", "message": "Updated the RoadRumble profiles for Bass Shakers to provide easier tuning of the dynamic frequencies.", "created_at": "2025-05-06T14:51:42Z", "repo": "SimHubUDPConnector", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d7aa2007f6e59600b05a4034557dac213f4ac7f7", "message": "Lua apps : Added two new properties for the RoadRumbleExtension to enable dynamic frequencies (RimRadius and angular speed by wheels).\nEffects :\nAdded new effect : Rangey 4 Wheel tyre slip x surge brakes only\nUpdated effect : Ro